# MediaVault Android Environment Configuration

Copy this file to `.env.local` and update with your configuration.

## Backend API
# The URL of your MediaVault backend API server
# Example: http://localhost:5000 (for local development)
# Example: http://192.168.1.100:5000 (for device testing on local network)
# Example: https://api.mediavault.app (for production)
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:5000
